    <description>This flow is triggered by scheduled path in another record triggered flow, to run in regular intervals and check the age for the open complaint cases. If complaint is still open after 72 hours (3 working days) 72 hour task notification is created and assigned to the owner of the case as a prompt/reminder to send an email to the customer with an update. Same is repeated is case is still open after 28 and 56 working days.</description>
